 "notes": "95% highest posterior density (HPD) credible region boundary extracted from Figure 4 (left panel) showing constraints on ultralight boson mass \u03bc and inverse decay constant f^-1 from black hole spin measurements of IRAS 09149-6206 (supermassive BH with \u03c4_BH = 450 Myr). Boundary traced from posterior probability density contours via edge detection on the raster PDF figure. The figure shows overlapping constraints from equilibrium and bosenova scenarios; the reported boundary represents the combined 95% HPD region. Conversion from pixel coordinates applied using log-linear calibration anchored to axis labels spanning \u03bc: 10^-20 to 10^-17 eV and f^-1: 10^-19 to 10^-11 GeV^-1. Confidence in extraction is limited by raster image resolution (~262\u00d7225 pixels) and inherent noise in contour detection. This paper derives new constraints using Bayesian statistical inference on black hole spin measurements rather than traditional experimental searches.",
